02:06.880 --> 02:10.280
<b>We are fans
of Dejiko-chan.</b>

02:11.180 --> 02:12.340
<b>What's this?
This is...!</b>

02:12.450 --> 02:13.920
<b>A tail!</b>

02:14.020 --> 02:15.580
<b>And Dejiko-chan's tail, too!</b>

02:15.690 --> 02:16.710
<b>Finders keepers!</b>

02:16.820 --> 02:18.080
<b>Do you dare be selfish!?</b>

02:18.190 --> 02:19.950
