02:21.560 --> 02:23.750
<b>We're falling down a hole!</b>

02:26.160 --> 02:29.790
<b>Thank you for visiting Hell.</b>

02:26.160 --> 02:29.790
<b>Hell
Welcome.</b>

02:29.900 --> 02:32.560
<b>I see you are holding
something in your hands.</b>

02:32.670 --> 02:35.870
<b>Is that Di Gi Charat's tail?</b>

02:35.970 --> 02:37.530
<b>Can I have that?</b>

02:37.640 --> 02:39.160
<b>No, you can't.</b>

02:39.280 --> 02:41.370
<b>We are giving this
back to Dejiko-chan!</b>

02:41.480 --> 02:44.810
<b>If you hand it over,
I can grant you any wish you want.</b>

02:44.910 --> 02:46.610
<b>How's that for an exchange?</b>

02:46.720 --> 02:48.780
<b>Grant...any wish?</b>

02:48.890 --> 02:50.350
<b>What do we do?</b>

02:51.390 --> 02:52.480
<b>No, we can't.</b>

02:52.590 --> 02:54.890
<b>We're going to return this
to Dejiko-chan!</b>

02:54.990 --> 02:57.650
<b>Because we are fans of Dejiko-chan!</b>

02:58.190 --> 03:00.130
<b>Oh, really? You can't?</b>

03:00.230 --> 03:02.890
<b>Then I guess you can't
go home so easily then!</b>

03:05.000 --> 03:07.630
