03:07.740 --> 03:09.900
<b>Thank you, Dejiko-chan.</b>

03:10.010 --> 03:11.440
<b>You don't have your tail nyu.</b>

03:11.540 --> 03:14.200
<b>You're right nyo.
What should I do!?</b>

03:14.310 --> 03:16.370
<b>Puchiko has her tail nyu.</b>

03:16.480 --> 03:18.210
<b>What? You dropped your tail?
I lost my tail nyo!</b>

03:18.310 --> 03:21.510
<b>Go look for it.
Just wear this Fuwa Fuwa key chain.</b>

03:21.620 --> 03:23.350
<b>Maybe it'll grow.
I'm doomed nyo!</b>

03:23.450 --> 03:24.420
<b>Welcome to our store.</b>

03:24.520 --> 03:27.420
<b>Dejiko-chan...
We found this!</b>

03:28.590 --> 03:30.920
<b>My tail nyo!</b>

03:31.030 --> 03:36.600
<b>Signs are Takeshi & Yoshimi</b>

03:31.030 --> 03:34.430
<b>I am Takeshi.
I am Yoshimi.</b>

03:34.530 --> 03:36.620
<b>Thank you nyo.</b>

03:37.000 --> 03:38.000
